---
title: Steps 5 and 10 — View own bookings (user) / any booking (admin)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as User or Admin
    participant P as protect
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant B as Booking model

    A->>P: GET /bookings
    alt not logged in
        P-->>A: 401 Not authorized
    end
    P->>C: getBookings()
    alt role = user
        C->>B: find({user: me, deletedAt: null})
    else role = admin
        C->>B: find({deletedAt: null})
    end
    B-->>C: bookings + hotel and user details
    C-->>A: 200 {count, data: bookings}

    A->>P: GET /bookings/:id
    P->>C: getBooking()
    C->>B: findOne(scope(req))
    alt another user's booking (user) or not found
        C-->>A: 404 No booking with this id
    end
    C-->>A: 200 {data: booking}
